  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Polygon Miden -- STARK-based ZK rollup with a unique client-side proving model enabling private transactions and account abstraction at scale. Stores OASIS holons and avatars with ZK-proven privacy. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
